# Composition-first (Q85)

Domain thinking is **objects + `besteht_aus` (composition)**, not a relational database or Relations-CRUD prison.

## Class / attribute analogy

A **Composition** is like a **class**. Each member is an **attribute**:

```text
class BOM {                 ← Composition (Objekt / Klasse)
  text   Name;     [1]      ← Attribut: Typ + Name + Multiplizität
  …      Position; [1]
  …      Menge;    [0..*]
}
```

| OOP | Tree / Relations |
|-----|------------------|
| Class | Composition node (e.g. Platine, BOM) |
| Attribute **name** | Member node **`name`** (required, never anonymous) |
| Attribute **type** | Member **`_wtt_type_id`** |
| Attribute **multiplicity** | On **`besteht_aus`** edge (Q78); default **`1`** (Q87 trial) |
| Field list | Outgoing **`besteht_aus`** targets (order = member order) |
| Inheritance | Along **`child_of`** only (Q66/Q86) — no separate `erbt_von`; attributes merge by name (child wins); inherited may be **hidden** on child; **Festwert** lives on the current node |
| Specialization type | **Datatype of a hierarchy child = father** (Q88). Child `_wtt_type_id` → WP parent. Attribute members are excluded (they keep their own type). |

No nameless composition edges. No “DB column without identifier.”

## Canonical shape

```text
Platine                          ← Composition
  besteht_aus → Name : text
  besteht_aus → (weitere Eigenschaften …)
  besteht_aus → BOM : …          ← eine Eigenschaft unter vielen

BOM                              ← Composition
  besteht_aus → Name : text
  besteht_aus → Position / Ref / Bauteil-Zuordnung / Menge / …
  → eine BOM-Zeile ist ein Objekt aus diesen Teilen
```

## Keep vs demote

| Keep | Demote / view-only |
|------|--------------------|
| `besteht_aus` = aggregation (typed named members) | Relations picker as the default product model |
| Typed named slots as Eigenschaften | “Table” as the primary domain noun |
| `child_of` = hierarchy + inheritance path | Band/`prop_bindings` as mental SoT |
| `node_ref` where a slot points at a catalog record | Cells/CSV/grid as the object model |
| Table UI as **presentation** of composition | Persisting “rows/cells” as the conceptual API |

## Language

- Prefer: Composition, Attribut (Name + Typ), Instanz, Slot, Record, Zuordnung.
- RelationType key: **`besteht_aus`** (legacy alias `composition`).
- Prefer block/product names that say **Composition / BOM instance**, not “Collection table database”.
- `table` datatype = optional **display contract** (Zeile/Kopf/Fuss), not “Platine is a table”.

## Do / don’t

- **Do** model Platine → BOM → line parts as nested composition with **named typed** members.
- **Do** keep `ref_scope` as a helper Relation, not the spine; typing = **`_wtt_type_id`** / Q88 only.
- **Don’t** invent more Relation types to replace composition aggregates.
- **Don’t** teach users “add a DB row”; teach “add a line object / fill attributes”.
- **Don’t** allow anonymous `besteht_aus` targets (always a Name + Type).
